<div class="shell narrow page-intro">
  <header>
    <p class="page-badge">Privacy</p>
    <h1 class="page-h1 page-h1--gradient">GameSearch Account Deletion</h1>
    <p class="lead">Request removal of your GameSearch account from the app or by email. Below is how to do it and what happens to your data.</p>
  </header>

  <section class="panel" aria-labelledby="how-heading">
    <h2 id="how-heading" class="panel-h2">How to delete your account</h2>
    <p class="muted">You can delete your account in the app:</p>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li><div><strong>Open the app</strong> on your device and sign in if you use an account.</div></li>
      <li><div><strong>Go to your profile or Settings</strong> from the main navigation.</div></li>
      <li><div><strong>Select Delete account</strong> (or equivalent wording in your language).</div></li>
      <li><div><strong>Confirm deletion</strong> when prompted. The account is removed after confirmation.</div></li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="panel" aria-labelledby="email-heading">
    <h2 id="email-heading" class="panel-h2">Request by email</h2>
    <p class="muted">If you cannot use the app or need help, email us from the address linked to your account:</p>
    <a class="email-link" href="mailto:gamesearch16@gmail.com?subject=GameSearch%20account%20deletion%20request">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"/><path d="m22 6-10 7L2 6"/></svg>
      gamesearch16@gmail.com
    </a>
  </section>

  <section class="panel" aria-labelledby="data-heading">
    <h2 id="data-heading" class="panel-h2">Data deletion</h2>
    <p class="muted">When your account is deleted, we remove account-level data, including:</p>
    <ul class="data-list">
      <li>Email address on the account</li>
      <li>User profile information</li>
      <li>Authentication data for that account</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="panel" aria-labelledby="retention-heading">
    <h2 id="retention-heading" class="panel-h2">Data retention</h2>
    <p class="muted">Some information may be deleted later, anonymized, or kept for a limited period where required for legal obligations, fraud prevention, security, or dispute resolution. For example, comments and related content may be deleted or anonymized so they are no longer tied to you.</p>
    <p class="muted retention-gap">Operational or technical records (such as server logs) may be retained only as long as necessary and in line with applicable law.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="panel" aria-labelledby="contact-heading">
    <h2 id="contact-heading" class="panel-h2">Contact</h2>
    <p class="muted">If you have trouble deleting your account or questions about this process, contact us at the email above and include the email address your GameSearch account uses.</p>
  </section>

  <p class="muted meta-line site-note">© GameSearch — account &amp; data information</p>
</div>
